{
  "info": {
    "name": "Finance Controller API",
    "description": "Collection de testes da API. Atualizada a cada fatia entregue (atual: F5 - lançamentos).\n\nUso: execute 'Register' ou 'Login'; o script de teste guarda o accessToken na variável de coleção {{accessToken}} e o cookie refresh_token fica no cookie jar do Postman (domínio localhost). Em ambiente local o cookie não é Secure (perfil local).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiPath",
      "value": "/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "usuario.teste@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "SenhaForte#2026",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "categoryId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "subcategoryId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "transactionId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Sistema",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Identity",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "registerUser",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devolve accessToken e user', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.user.email).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiPath}}",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cadastra o utilizador. 201 com cookie refresh_token; 409 EMAIL_ALREADY_REGISTERED se o e-mail já existe; 400 VALIDATION_FAILED."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiPath}}",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "200 com cookie refresh_token; 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS (mesma resposta para senha errada e e-mail inexistente); 429 TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS após 5 falhas em 15 min."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "refreshToken",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiPath}}",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Usa o cookie refresh_token do cookie jar e o rotaciona. Reusar um token já rotacionado devolve 401 e revoga a família."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiPath}}",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Revoga a sessão de renovação e limpa o cookie."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "getCurrentUser",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('id e email', () => {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(b.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(b.email).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiPath}}",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requer Bearer token. Sem token válido: 401 application/problem+json."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Categories",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "listCategories",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const list = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('lista de categorias', () => pm.expect(list).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "if (list.length) { pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', list[0].id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/categories?type=EXPENSE",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiPath}}",
                "categories"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "EXPENSE",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "200 com as categorias do utilizador (11 semeadas no cadastro), ordenadas por nome. Ative o parâmetro type=EXPENSE|INCOME para filtrar (inclui BOTH). 401 sem token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "createCategory",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const c = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('tem Outros protegida', () => pm.expect(c.subcategories.some(s => s.name === 'Outros' && s.protected)).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', c.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('subcategoryId', c.subcategories.find(s => !s.protected).id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/categories",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiPath}}",
                "categories"
              ]
            },
            "description": "201 com a categoria e a subcategoria protegida Outros; 409 CATEGORY_NAME_DUPLICATED (ignora caixa e espaços); 400 VALIDATION_FAILED.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pets\",\n  \"type\": \"EXPENSE\",\n  \"icon\": \"pets\",\n  \"color\": \"#795548\",\n  \"subcategories\": [\"Veterinário\", \"Ração\"]\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
